    text: Regarde-le.
  - still: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 9384577671d1a36bdbbb027c5f5e2958, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
    seconds: 2.4
    panFrom: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 1}
    panTo: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 1}
    speaker: 
    lineId: cs11f_01
    text: "[Short grass to a straight edge, then only sky. Far off, a man in a dark
      overcoat.]  Il ne te conna\xEEt pas."
  - still: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 9384577671d1a36bdbbb027c5f5e2958, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
    seconds: 2.4
    panFrom: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 1}
    panTo: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 1}
    speaker: 
    lineId: cs11f_02
    text: '[A raised forearm in a white glove, the palm out.]  Les faibles, on leur
      demande.'
  - still: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 9384577671d1a36bdbbb027c5f5e2958, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
    seconds: 2.4
    panFrom: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 1}
    panTo: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 1}
    speaker: 
    lineId: cs11f_03
    text: '[His knees in the grass. His hat has fallen.]  Les forts, on les casse
      d''abord.'
  - still: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 9384577671d1a36bdbbb027c5f5e2958, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
    seconds: 2.4
    panFrom: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 1}
    panTo: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 1}
    speaker: 
    lineId: cs11f_04
    text: '[His shoes walk through the grass, at the speed of the metronome.]  Il
      ne pleure pas.'
  - still: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 9384577671d1a36bdbbb027c5f5e2958, type: 3}
    video: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
    seconds: 2.2
    panFrom: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 1}
    panTo: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 1}
    speaker: 
    lineId: cs11f_05
    text: '[The edge. Grass, and nobody. The wind.]  Encore.'
